              <content>
                <p>Repeal the subsection, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-23__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-23__qstr-1__subsec-7">
                  <num>7</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>If:</p>
                  </content>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-23__qstr-1__subsec-7__para-a">
                    <num>a</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>	(a)	the Minister purports to give a document to a person in accordance with a method (the <b><i>relevant method</i></b>) specified in <ref href="#sec-494B">section 494B</ref> (including in a case covered by <ref href="#sec-494A">section 494A</ref>) but makes an error in doing so; and</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-23__qstr-1__subsec-7__para-b">
                    <num>b</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>the person nonetheless receives the document or a copy of it;</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p>then, despite the error:</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-23__qstr-1__subsec-7__para-c">
                    <num>c</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>the document is taken to have been given in accordance with the relevant method; and</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-23__qstr-1__subsec-7__para-d">
                    <num>d</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>the person is taken to have received the document:</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-23__qstr-1__subsec-7__para-i">
                    <num>i</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>at the time mentioned in this section for the relevant method; or</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-23__qstr-1__subsec-7__para-ii">
                    <num>ii</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>if the person can show that the person received the document at a later time—at that later time.</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-24">
              <num>24</num>
